  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "On a remote volcanic island that everybody wants to leave, little Nana learns to stay. Her mother, Nia, went into exile right after she was born and Nana grows up in the family of her father. One day, the family learns that Nia is ill. Nana begins to develop high fevers and is sent to the foot of a volcano for treatment. There she encounters a world steeped in magical realism, between dreams and reality. Later, when Nana is a teenager, her mother Nia finally returns to the island.",
          "runtime": 96,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "ES",
        "iso_639_1": "es",
        "name": "Español",
        "english_name": "Spanish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "En una isla volcánica remota, un lugar del que todos quieren irse, Nana ha aprendido a quedarse. Su madre, Nia, que sufre una misteriosa enfermedad, se fue poco después de su nacimiento. Cuando Nana tiene fiebre alta, la envían al pie de un volcán para que la traten. Allí, se encuentra con un mundo suspendido entre los sueños y la realidad. Años después, cuando Nana es una adolescente, Nia regresa.",
          "runtime": 96,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "PL",
        "iso_639_1": "pl",
        "name": "Polski",
        "english_name": "Polish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://imovision.com.br/hanami",
          "overview": "Em uma ilha vulcânica isolada, Nana aprendeu a permanecer. Sua mãe desapareceu pouco após seu nascimento, carregando consigo uma doença envolta em mistério. Quando uma febre devastadora acomete Nana, ela é levada ao sopé de um vulcão em busca de cura. Lá, entre o calor pulsante da terra e o eco de antigos segredos, ela descobre um mundo onde os limites entre sonho e realidade se misturam.",
          "runtime": 96,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "In una remota isola vulcanica, dal quale tutti vorrebbero partire, Nana impara a restare. Sua madre Nia, affetta da una misteriosa malattia, parte subito dopo la sua nascita. Quando a Nana viene la febbre alta ed è mandata ai piedi di un vulcano per essere curata, incontra un mondo sospeso tra sogno e realtà. Anni dopo, quando Nana è adolescente, Nia ritorna.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DE",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Auf einer abgelegenen Vulkaninsel, von der alle wegwollen, lernt Nana zu bleiben.\r Ihre Mutter Nia, die an einer mysteriösen Krankheit leidet, verlässt die Insel bald nach ihrer Geburt. Als Nana hohes Fieber bekommt und zur Behandlung an den Fuss eines Vulkans geschickt wird, begegnet sie einer Welt zwischen Traum und Wirklichkeit. Jahre später, als Nana ein Teenager ist, kehrt Nia zurück.",
          "runtime": 96,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "本片以佛得角群岛中名为“福戈”（火焰）的火山岛为背景，讲述了少女娜娜在逃离与留守的宿命间挣扎的成长故事。幼年时，身患怪病的母亲妮雅不告而别；高烧昏迷的娜娜被送往火山脚下治疗，意外坠入虚实交织的异界。在火山灰烬与潮汐声中，梦境与现实如岩浆般交融，勾勒出岛屿子民永恒的生命叩问。费尔南德斯凭借本片荣获第77届洛迦诺电影节金豹奖最佳新导演奖。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "花见"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Sur une île volcanique isolée que tout le monde veut quitter, Nana apprend à rester. Sa mère, Nia, souffrant d’une mystérieuse maladie, est partie peu après sa naissance. Lorsque Nana est prise de fortes fièvres, on l’envoie se faire soigner au pied d’un volcan, où elle découvre un monde suspendu entre rêves et réalité. Des années plus tard, alors que Nana est adolescente, Nia revient.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      }
    ]
